  "summary": "This experiment tested transformer aggregation with concat fusion in a multimodal setup, achieving validation accuracy of 0.7207 (vs. 0.725 for weighted fusion in config_039). The result suggests concat fusion may not outperform weighted fusion, though the small accuracy difference could reflect other uncontrolled factors. Uncertainty remains about whether fusion strategy alone drives performance or if encoder/aggregation interactions influence outcomes."
